# This repo holds the documentation site (served via GitHub Pages from
# /docs) and project README. The compiled application is distributed via
# GitHub Releases, NOT committed here — keep the binary payload out so
# the repo stays small.

# ── Application binaries / runtime payload ──────────────────────────────
LesserEvil.exe
LesserEvil.exe.config
*.dll
/Resources/
/plugins/
/config/
/maps/
/Windower/

# ── Nested / unrelated projects ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Forest is its own separate git repo that lives in this folder; it must
# not be tracked by (or embedded into) the docs repo.
/Forest/

# ── Build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.pdb
*.user

# ── OS / editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vs/
.idea/

# ── Backups ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
